      "voiceName": "Meghan McCain",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We're live! piped.video/live/BGN9aNagE0I\n\n\n\nMeghan McCain (@MeghanMcCain)\n\nExcited to welcome Rep. @EliseStefanik to Citizen McCain today!\n\nJoin us live at 12pm ET piped.video/BGN9aNagE0I\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/MeghanMcCain/status/2044424475999957176#m",
